try"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n8" value="8" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#605E5C;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1235" y="460" width="20" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n9" value="9" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#742774;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1690" y="300" width="20" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n10" value="10" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#742774;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1490" y="475" width="20" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n11" value="11" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#742774;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1875" y="560" width="20" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="steps" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C8C6C4;strokeWidth=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="770" width="1150" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="steps_h" value="Numbered path" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#201F1E;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="776" width="400" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="steps_c1" value="1  Fabric shortcut / mirror / copy brings source files into the OneLake Lakehouse&lt;br&gt;2  The pipeline picks the files up from OneLake&lt;br&gt;3  The pipeline registers each file in the control table (register + state)&lt;br&gt;4  The pipeline copies the raw files to Blob raw/&lt;br&gt;5  The pipeline calls Document Intelligence prebuilt-read; extracted text comes back&lt;br&gt;6  The pipeline writes chunked JSON to Blob chunks/" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#323130;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="802" width="560" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="steps_c2" value="7  The AI Search indexer pulls from Blob&lt;br&gt;8  The integrated vectorizer auto-embeds through the Foundry OpenAI deployment&lt;br&gt;9  The user asks in Teams or M365 Copilot, which reach the Copilot Studio agent&lt;br&gt;10  Knowledge query to AI Search; hybrid + ranked results come back&lt;br&gt;11  Grounded answer plus citations linked back to the raw files in Blob" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#323130;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="615" y="802" width="555" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="legend" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C8C6C4;strokeWidth=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1210" y="770" width="680" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="leg_h" value="Legend" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#201F1E;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1225" y="776" width="200" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg1" value="DEFAULT" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;fillColor=#0078D4;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=9;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1225" y="810" width="68" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg1t" value="Copilot Studio agent: the default, low-code conversational surface" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#323130;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1305" y="805" width="570" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg2" value="OPTIONAL" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;fillColor=#605E5C;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=9;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1225" y="846" width="68" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg2t" value="Foundry Agent Service: alternative runtime that uses an Azure AI Search tool" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#323130;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1305" y="841" width="570" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg3t" value="Solid arrows: data and query flow. Dashed arrows: secrets / RBAC from Key Vault to the pipeline and Search, the integrated-vectorizer auto-embed (8), the optional Foundry path and the citation links (11)." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#323130;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1225" y="878" width="650" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="footer" value="RAG Knowledge-Base Pattern | End-to-end data and query flow | v1.7.0 | Icons: Microsoft Azure Architecture Icons (V24)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;fontColor=#8A8886;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="942" width="1880" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>